es with a wide range of difficulty</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bespoke art for every puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual hints for every puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Option to unlock all puzzles</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorblind accessible by default</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/1a9ad018d7e54f0c1d1e2ca421292e8e.poster.avif?t=1756669735\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/1a9ad018d7e54f0c1d1e2ca421292e8e.webm?t=1756669735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/1a9ad018d7e54f0c1d1e2ca421292e8e.mp4?t=1756669735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT ABOUT UDLR_MODIFY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>UDLR_Modify</i> was originally created for the Acerola Jam 0 as a prototype with 20 puzzles, where it was among the most popular  games submitted. <i>UDLR</i> is the full-length follow up to that game, keeping the best puzzles from the original while adding many more, adding new item types, and modifying some of the base mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/ccd9aad1329926bb5aaa3fa1f00cee29.poster.avif?t=1756669735\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/ccd9aad1329926bb5aaa3fa1f00cee29.webm?t=1756669735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/ccd9aad1329926bb5aaa3fa1f00cee29.mp4?t=1756669735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Two-Headed Deer"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/83764380076dcdc5c5c6fe04a5c64b4fc0494cb4/header.jpg?t=1756669735","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"UDLR","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_32 CPU with SSE2 instructions, any x86_64 CPU, ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Two-Headed Deer"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/9c7fdb70c2b89fb1fadd6e81d84dfe371f6b2e9e/ss_9c7fdb70c2b89fb1fadd6e81d84dfe371f6b2e9e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756669735","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/9c7fdb70c2b89fb1fadd6e81d84dfe371f6b2e9e/ss_9c7fdb70c2b89fb1fadd6e81d84dfe371f6b2e9e.600x338.jpg?t=1756669735"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/f9e25790fedb9ed113d7d70e8f4ecf3d6ea8cc5e/ss_f9e25790fedb9ed113d7d70e8f4ecf3d6ea8cc5e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756669735","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/f9e25790fedb9ed113d7d7